    "name": "Shared Bill Splitter API (D2)",
    "description": "CMSC501-1 practicum — Deliverable #2 demo collection.\n\n**Setup:** run `go run .` from practicum-project (or `make run`), then import this file into Postman.\n\n**Collection variables (initial values for a fresh DB):**\n| Variable | Initial | Set by |\n|----------|---------|--------|\n| `groupId` | 1 | Create group |\n| `personId1` … `personId5` | 1 … 5 | Add person requests |\n| `chargeId` … `chargeId4` | 1 … 4 | Add charge requests |\n\n**Tip:** run folder **1. Valid Demo Flow** top to bottom — each create step overwrites ids from the API response so later requests stay in sync.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
